title: Start
---
Look at you. Moving with purpose. #line:Level2Dialog_001
Kinda like a squirrel who just realized it’s not autumn anymore. Still — credit where credit’s due. I thought you'd be sobbing in a ditch by now. #line:Level2Dialog_002
... #line:Level2Dialog_003
You’re probably feeling proud. Don’t. The forest let you get this far. It’s toying with you. Like a cat with a laser pointer. Except you're the laser, and the cat’s a dimensional apex predator made of regret. #line:Level2Dialog_004
See those voices? Those aren’t echoes. They’re leftovers. Adventurers, thinkers, emotionally unstable overachievers. Now they’re just... ambiance. Screaming furniture in the mood lighting. #line:Level2Dialog_005
They gave up. Gave in. Got turned into poetic metaphors for failure. And buddy, they love company. #line:Level2Dialog_006
... #line:Level2Dialog_007
So. You keep moving, or you join their pity party. I’d recommend moving. You’re not dressed for ghosthood. #line:Level2Dialog_008
===
